      "locator": {
        "page": 5,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p5_s2"
      },
      "text": "The Komplex Payload : Is the final component of the Komplex malware, with the sole purpose of downloading and executing a file, as requested by the C&C servers.",
