      "locator": {
        "page": 5,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p5_s3"
      },
      "text": "In other words, Komplex is an APT28/Sofacy component that can be distributed via email, disguised as a PDF document, to establish a foothold in a system.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
